            "When you make a check to perform the Guard action, you gain a bonus success if you or your target is mounted on a steed. When you succeed on a Guard action check, you may spend (op) as follows: (op)+: Give a target at range 0-3 the Emboldened condition. Maximum (op) spent this way up to your school rank."
        }

        MASTERY_ABILITY ^"Reputation Sentinel" {
            "You may use the Guard action during intrigues. When you do, increase the TN of Scheme action checks against the guarded target by 1, plus an additional 1 per two bonus successes."
        }
        STARTING_OUTFIT [
            "lacquered armor", "traveling clothes",
            "daishō (katana or scimitar, wakizashi)", "yari (spear)",
            "daikyu (bow)", "quiver of arrows", "knife",
