            ^"Opportunities" STRING "(op)(op): The spirits do not become aware that anyone searched for them. (op)(op): Reduce TN of checks using the Sense approach by 1 until end of next scene. (op)(op)(op): If you are a practitioner of meishōdō, you learn the true name of one spirit you detected."
