            ^"Effects" STRING "If you succeed, you ascertain the laws and cultural norms of the place you are visiting. You can logically discern whether a proposed course of action is legal or illegal, rude or polite."
            ^"Opportunities" STRING "(op)(op): Reduce TN of checks using the Recall approach by 1 until end of next scene. (op)(op): Through study and use of common language roots, you can make yourself understood in the common language of the place (intelligible but not fluent)."
        }
