            ^"Effects" STRING "If you succeed, choose one resource: potable water, food, or shelter. You find a sign of the nearest source and can determine the direction to reach it."
            ^"Opportunities" STRING "(op): If you succeed, determine the distance (in days journeyed) to the resource. (op)(op): Reduce TN of checks using the Survey approach by 1 until end of next scene."
        }
